# Auth & routing

This app is the public reservation catalog. There is no staff login, no role layout, and no auth middleware.

- Home is `/` and uses the `public` layout.
- Catalog calls go through `publicReservationApi` (`/app-api`), which stays on the public allowlist in `apiFetch`.
